%% Create-mission flow in the Missions panel (list -> form -> save).
%% An entity field's "Add new" row can create instantly (sync add), wait for
%% the user to draw on the map (async add + inline hint), or open a dialog
%% (createDialog, e.g. impact data).
flowchart TD
    A([User clicks New Mission]) --> B[MissionStore.openCreate]
    B --> C[MissionForm opens<br/>every MISSION_SCHEMA key = empty]

    C --> D{Field type}
    D -->|text / number / datetime / select| E[Value typed or picked]
    D -->|entity| F[EntityField dropdown filled by<br/>EntitySource.options parentId]

    F --> G{User picks}
    G -->|existing item| H[value = item id]
    G -->|Add new| I{EntitySource kind}

    I -->|add returns item<br/>commander| J[Item created instantly]
    I -->|add returns Promise<br/>attackPoint, route| K[Inline hint + spinner<br/>source.addHint, Cancel button]
    I -->|createDialog<br/>impactData| L[ImpactDataDialog opens<br/>name pre-filled]

    K --> K1[mapEngine.startDrawPoint / startDrawLine]
    K1 --> K2{User}
    K2 -->|clicks / double-clicks map| K3[Shape saved via entityService.create<br/>Promise resolves with item]
    K2 -->|Cancel or field unmounts| K4[source.cancelAdd<br/>mapEngine.cancelDrawing]

    L --> L1[Fill radius / speed / details]
    L1 --> L2{Valid?}
    L2 -->|no| L1
    L2 -->|Cancel| M[Nothing selected]
    L2 -->|yes - Add| L3[Record pushed to impactDataList<br/>onClose item]

    J --> H
    K3 --> H
    L3 --> H
    K4 --> M

    E --> O[Draft values updated<br/>dependents cleared]
    H --> O
    M --> O

    O --> P([User clicks Create])
    P --> Q{Required fields filled?}
    Q -->|no| R[Show field errors] --> D
    Q -->|yes| S[MissionStore.add values]
    S --> T[Mission stored<br/>in-memory now, POST /missions later]
    T --> U[MissionStore.showList<br/>new card visible]

    style K fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style K1 fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style K3 fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style L fill:#3b82f6,color:#fff
    style L3 fill:#3b82f6,color:#fff
    style S fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style T fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
